sequenceDiagram
    title Numeric Comparison Pairing Example

    participant Product as Product<br>[implements GapCentralResponse]
    participant CN as CN<br>[implements GapCentral]

    note over Product, CN: Precondition: connected.<br>IoCapabilities set to displayYesNo.

    rect rgb(230, 230, 240)
        note over Product, CN: Initiate pairing
        Product->>CN: PairAndBond()
        CN-->>Product: AuthenticationRequired(<br>isNumericComparison=true, passkey=485923)

        note over Product: Display "485923" to the user.<br>User verifies the same number appears on the peripheral.
    end

    rect rgb(230, 230, 240)
        note over Product, CN: User confirms match
        Product->>CN: NumericComparisonConfirm(true)
        CN-->>Product: NumberOfBondsChanged(1)
        CN-->>Product: PairingResult(pairedSuccessfully=true)

        note over Product: Bond stored. Keys (LTK, IRK) exchanged.<br>Future reconnections use encryption without re-pairing.
    end
